    "title": "GB Signs to AD 93 for New Album Herzsprung - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Walden Green ,\n12 hours ago Danish musician Gustav Berntsen, who records as GB, has signed to AD 93, where he’ll release his new album Herzsprung on August 21. Berntsen pieced together the LP’s lyrics from copies of Metro, a London daily newspaper, then paid for studio time with the money he made from appearing in Jaguar’s 2024 ad campaign. Below, listen to lead single “Adrenaline.” Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
